title: Palo Alto: Environment (XML API)
agents: palo_alto_api
catalog: hw/network/palo_alto
license: GPLv3
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 This check monitors the environmental sensors (temperature, fans, power) of a
 Palo Alto Networks firewall as read from {show system environmentals} through
 the PAN-OS XML API.

 The service goes {CRIT} when the firewall raises the sensor's alarm flag. For
 temperature sensors the reading is published as a metric and optional upper
 temperature levels can be configured.

item:
 The sensor category and description, e.g. {thermal Temperature @ Slot 1}.

discovery:
 One service is created for each environmental sensor.
